太陽みたいにShiny！ ふわふわ～♪
Shiny like the sun! Fluffy-soft~♪

97
00:38:34,383 --> 00:38:38,783
ひらり軌跡描くように そうきっと それがMy Way！
Gently drawing a trajectory, yes, surely that's My Way!

98
